{"v":[[1,"The words of the Preacher, the son of David, king in Jerusalem."],[2,"Vanity of vanities, saith the Preacher, vanity of vanities; all is vanity."],[3,"What profit hath a man of all his labour which he taketh under the sun?"],[4,"One generation passeth away, and another generation cometh: but the earth abideth for ever."],[5,"The sun also ariseth, and the sun goeth down, and hasteth to his place where he arose."],[6,"The wind goeth toward the south, and turneth about unto the north; it whirleth about continually, and the wind returneth again according to his circuits."],[7,"All the rivers run into the sea; yet the sea is not full; unto the place from whence the rivers come, thither they return again."],[8,"All things are full of labour; man cannot utter it: the eye is not satisfied with seeing, nor the ear filled with hearing."],[9,"The thing that hath been, it is that which shall be; and that which is done is that which shall be done: and there is no new thing under the sun."],[10,"Is there any thing whereof it may be said, See, this is new? it hath been already of old time, which was before us."],[11,"There is no remembrance of former things; neither shall there be any remembrance of things that are to come with those that shall come after."],[12,"I the Preacher was king over Israel in Jerusalem."],[13,"And I gave my heart to seek and search out by wisdom concerning all things that are done under heaven: this sore travail hath God given to the sons of man to be exercised therewith."],[14,"I have seen all the works that are done under the sun; and, behold, all is vanity and vexation of spirit."],[15,"That which is crooked cannot be made straight: and that which is wanting cannot be numbered."],[16,"I communed with mine own heart, saying, Lo, I am come to great estate, and have gotten more wisdom than all they that have been before me in Jerusalem: yea, my heart had great experience of wisdom and knowledge."],[17,"And I gave my heart to know wisdom, and to know madness and folly: I perceived that this also is vexation of spirit."],[18,"For in much wisdom is much grief: and he that increaseth knowledge increaseth sorrow."]],"w":{"1":[["divrei","[the] words of","H1697"],["kohelet","Teacher","H6953"],["ben","[the] son of","H1121"],["david","David","H1732"],["melekh","king","H4428"],["bi-rushalim","in Jerusalem","H3389"]],"2":[["havel","futility of","H1892"],["havalim","futilities","H1892"],["'amar","he said","H559"],["kohelet","Teacher","H6953"],["havel","futility of","H1892"],["havalim","futilities","H1892"],["ha-kol","<the> everything","H3605"],["havel","[is] futility","H1892"]],"3":[["mah","what?","H4100"],["yitron","profit","H3504"],["la-'adam","[belongs] to <the> humankind","H120"],["be-khol","in all","H3605"],["amal-o","toil his","H5999"],["she-iya'amol","that he toils","H5998"],["tachat","under","H8478"],["ha-shamesh","the sun","H8121"]],"4":[["dor","a generation","H1755"],["holekh","[is] going","H1980"],["ve-dor","and a generation","H1755"],["ba'","[is] coming","H935"],["ve-ha-'aretz","and the earth","H776"],["le-'olam","for ever","H5769"],["'omadet","[is] continuing","H5975"]],"5":[["ve-zarach","and it rises","H2224"],["ha-shemesh","the sun","H8121"],["u-va'","and it goes","H935"],["ha-shamesh","the sun","H8121"],["ve-'el","and to","H413"],["mekom-o","place its","H4725"],["sho'ef","[is] panting","H7602"],["zoreach","[is] rising","H2224"],["hu'","it","H1931"],["sham","there","H8033"]],"6":[["holekh","[it is] going","H1980"],["'el","to","H413"],["darom","[the] south","H1864"],["ve-sovev","and [it is] circling","H5437"],["'el","to","H413"],["tzafon","[the] north","H6828"],["sovev","circling around","H5437"],["sovev","circling around","H5437"],["holekh","[is] going","H1980"],["ha-ruach","the wind","H7307"],["ve-'al","and on","H5921"],["sevivota-v","circuits its","H5439"],["shav","[is] returning","H7725"],["ha-ruach","the wind","H7307"]],"7":[["kol","all","H3605"],["ha-nechalim","the rivers","H5158"],["holekhim","[ar